message test: a Pinned rod that its line turns at the static start (bodyIC static)
-- Rod 1 hangs from a fixed pin at End A (0, 0, -10) to End B (0, 0, -30); the rope from End B to
-- the anchor at (80, 0, -60) pulls it aside, so the static solve turns the rod about its pin and
-- moves End B while End A stays put. The completion line reports both the move and the turn.
